name tabfigures
category Package
revision 25202
shortdesc Maintain vertical alignment of figures
relocated 1
longdesc Knuth designed his original fonts with tabular figures (figures
longdesc whose width is uniform); this makes some layout problems rather
longdesc simple. In more recent times, fonts (such as Minion Pro), which
longdesc offer proportionally spaced figures, are increasingly being
longdesc used. The package provides mechanisms whereby such proportional
longdesc figures may still be aligned in tabular style (for example, in
longdesc the table of contents).
runfiles size=2
